  <data name="UupReleasesHeader.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Windows release</value></data>
  <data name="UupReleasesHint.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>The list comes straight from Windows Update, with no third-party sites.</value></data>
  <data name="UupChannelsTip.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Windows 11 — latest version: what Windows Update installs on regular PCs now.
24H2 — the original build of version 24H2; the latest update is added when the image is built.
Windows 10 22H2 — the last version of Windows 10.
Release Preview — the next update shortly before release; usually stable.
Insider Beta, Dev, Canary — preview builds (advanced mode only): may be unstable, tweaks may not work.</value></data>
