  <data name="UupLatestUpdateTip.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Windows is up to date right away — no cumulative update to install afterwards.
For 25H2 it is required: without the update you get the original build 26100.1 (essentially 24H2).
Adds about 5 GB to the download and from 20 minutes to an hour or more to the build, depending on the computer; needs administrator rights (the app asks).</value></data>
